<title>UK: Dresdner Finance adds 100 bln lire to 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>Dresdner Finance adds 100 bln lire to 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint leads BNP, BNL, Dresdner Kleinwort Benson and Bear Stearns.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DRESDNER FINANCE NV</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  DRESDNER BANK AG</p>
<p> AMT   *400 BLN ITL   COUPON     7.25	MATURITY    07.FEB.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE *101.35    PAY DATE    07.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> SALE LIMITS US/UK/IT/GE/NL</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   MGT/UND    0.75	SELL CONC   1.25</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>	     *LAUNCHED ON WEDNESDAY FOR 300 BILLION LIRE AT 101.30</p>
</text>
